      "result_description": "Martians CC - Saturday 1st XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "247090",
      "match_notes": "<p><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Day started with overcast weather condition which reduced match to 35 overs. Martians won toss and elected to bat first.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">With equal contributions from all and wonderful last wicket partnership of 50+ between A</span><a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ameer.mehfil/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(var(--fe0,0,55,107),1); text-decoration: none;\" tabindex=\"0\">meer Mehfil</a><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;and Shibin Martians set target of 191 for opponents. Spartans Captian Kamal &nbsp;Prabhakar&nbsp;was the pick of the&nbsp;bowlers with 4/27 who wrapped up Martians in 25.1 overs.</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Spartans started of well and before carrying the rhythm first wicket lost with a stunning runout by Javid. By the time 13 overs completed Spartans scores 82 with loss of just one wicket with Anil and Gursharan Singh in the crease&nbsp;and rain delayed the game. After 30 minutes of break game resumed.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">First over after delay Spartans scores 2 boundaries </span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">and simply that was it for them for rest of the match.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">In second over Nas took one wicket and Shibin runout another&nbsp;batsman. After both set batsman departed things were easy for Martians. Joining Nas, Ramees</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;also taking wickets.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">From 82/1 at 13 overs with stunning performance of Nas and Ramees&nbsp;</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Spartans were&nbsp;bowled out for 97/10 at 20. Nas 4 wickets Ramees</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;3 wickets and 3 stunning runouts.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
